{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21920","headline":"句 · 元稹","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儿歌杨柳叶，妾拂石榴花。\n松门待制应全远，药树监搜可得知。\n髻鬟峨峨高一尺，门前立地看春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《诗人玉屑》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩人玉屑_(四庫全書本)）"}